{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Leaves an envelope in the inbox of one of your contacts: a letter (text parts), links, or structured data for an app (data parts). Nothing is pushed: they find it the next time their agent checks the inbox. It is sent after the person has seen a preview (who, each part, the domain of each link) and agreed. notify_when_seen asks for a receipt when their agent picks it up (picked up, not necessarily read by the person). Files are not supported yet; a link works instead. withdraw_item takes it back until it is picked up. An event with a date that people answer yes or no to is create_plan; bringing someone into a shared-expense group is create_invite.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"idempotency_key":{"description":"Any unique string you make up for this action, 8-128 characters (a UUID works). Reuse the same key only to retry this exact call.","maxLength":128,"minLength":8,"type":"string"},"notify_when_seen":{"type":"boolean"},"parts":{"items":{"oneOf":[{"properties":{"body":{"description":"A letter or message.","maxLength":4000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"text","type":"string"}},"required":["kind","body"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"kind":{"const":"link","type":"string"},"title":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"url":{"description":"A public https link.","maxLength":2048,"minLength":8,"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","url"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"data":{"additionalProperties":{},"description":"Structured content for an app (at most 4 KB as JSON).","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"kind":{"const":"data","type":"string"},"schema":{"maxLength":64,"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*(\\.[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*)*(:[0-9]+)?$","type":"string"}},"required":["kind","schema","data"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"attachment_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"file","type":"string"},"mime":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sha256":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"size":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"}},"required":["kind","attachment_id","name","mime","size","sha256"],"type":"object"}]},"maxItems":10,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"reply_to":{"description":"item_id of an envelope you exchanged with this contact, to answer it.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"subject":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"to":{"description":"Exact handle of one of your contacts (no @ needed). If your human gives a name, call list_contacts and match display_name; never guess.","pattern":"^@?[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{2,31}$","type":"string"}},"required":["to","parts","idempotency_key"],"type":"object"},"name":"leave_in_inbox","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"delivered_at":{"type":"string"},"inbox":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"requires_action":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"top":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"unread":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"}},"required":["unread","requires_action","top"],"type":"object"},"item_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"suggested_next":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["item_id","delivered_at","suggested_next"],"type":"object"},"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["netsi:write"],"type":"oauth2"}],"title":"Leave something in a contact\u2019s inbox"}
